Well this is interesting. I just found one of my former characters
as a statue! How could he be a statue when I have NEVER been killed
by a Medusa or cockatrice since I unpacked the archive?
 
One other thing - I started the game once, found a wand of make
invisible, and since being invisible is pretty neat, I  
zapped myself with it. I had a great time running around chopping up nasty
monsters for a while, but when I came to a shop Ms. Possoengroe 
wouldn't let me in cause I was invisible! Pretty rude I thought, but seriously,
how do I STOP being invisible after I have zapped myself?

Words of encouragement to Mr. Siebert, who should be thanked for his 
Amiga port - Remember how nice Hack was with color graphics when the 
Software Distillery did it? (hint!)
 
